# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages headers file. Vite copies public/ into dist/
# verbatim, so this ships with every build. Hosts that don't read _headers
# (Vercel, nginx, S3+CloudFront, ...) need the same headers configured by
# hand — DEPLOY.md carries the equivalents.
#
# CSP rationale:
#   script-src 'wasm-unsafe-eval'  - the kaspa/fourk wasm modules are
#       compiled in-browser; without this, WebAssembly.instantiate throws.
#   style-src 'unsafe-inline'      - Tailwind (and React inline style props)
#       set styles via inline <style>/style attributes.
#   connect-src wss: https:        - the app discovers arbitrary public
#       Kaspa nodes through the resolver at runtime; their hostnames cannot
#       be known ahead of time, so the whole wss:/https: schemes must be
#       open. Everything else (scripts, styles, images) stays same-origin.
#   img-src data:                  - generated avatars/QR-style images use
#       data: URIs.
#   frame-ancestors 'none'         - the app manages real crypto keys in
#       localStorage; never allow it to be framed (clickjacking). This
#       directive only works as a real header — meta CSP ignores it — which
#       is why hosts that drop _headers must recreate it (see DEPLOY.md).
#   object-src 'none' / base-uri 'self' / form-action 'self' - standard
#       lockdown; the app has no plugins, no <base>, no cross-site forms.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' wss: https:; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

# Hashed build output is immutable — cache it forever. This includes the
# ~11.7MB kaspa wasm; hosts brotli-compress it automatically on the wire
# (no precompression step needed here), and with `immutable` each browser
# downloads it once per release.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
